<title>GERMANY: FORECAST - German ZEW data on 6-month growth trend.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - German ZEW data on 6-month growth trend.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table gives data on expectations of growth and industry trends for the six months from February 1997, issued by the ZEW Zentrum fuer Europaeische Wirtschaftsforschung GmbH research institute.</p>
<p>The percentage figures are compiled from a survey of 306</p>
<p>firms conducted from February 3-18. Figures in brackets show the</p>
<p>change from December's survey.</p>
<p>ECONOMY - ASSESSMENT OF THE GENERAL ECONOMIC SITUATION</p>
<p>				Good	  Normal	  Bad</p>
<p> Germany		 0.4  (-0.9)   40.3 (-9.4)   59.3(+10.3)</p>
<p> U.S.		   84.3  (+5.9)   15.7 (-5.9)    0.0(+-0.0)</p>
<p> Japan		   0.7  (+0.7)   15.6 (-0.2)   83.7 (-0.5)</p>
<p> Britain		53.4  (+3.8)   44.9 (-2.1)    1.7 (-1.7)</p>
<p> France		  0.0 (+-0.0)   54.0 (+2.1)   46.0 (-2.1)</p>
<p> Italy		   1.1  (-1.0)   65.1 (+0.2)   33.8 (+1.2)</p>
<p>ECONOMY - EXPECTATIONS FOR THE NEXT SIX MONTHS</p>
<p>			    Improve	 No change     Worsen</p>
<p> Germany		64.3  (-6.8)   33.7 (+5.1)    2.0 (+1.7)</p>
<p> U.S.		    7.7  (+1.5)   86.3 (+1.1)    6.0 (+0.4)</p>
<p> Japan		  51.7  (+3.1)   43.5 (-0.5)    4.8 (-2.6)</p>
<p> Britain		11.6  (-1.5)   80.8 (+0.6)    7.6 (+0.9)</p>
<p> France		 55.5  (-3.1)   42.4 (+2.7)    2.1 (+0.4)</p>
<p> Italy		  35.0  (-0.9)   61.8 (+1.8)    3.2 (-0.9)</p>
<p>INDUSTRY SECTORS - PROFIT EXPECTATIONS FOR NEXT SIX MONTHS</p>
<p>			    Improve	 No change     Worsen</p>
<p> Banks		   50.0 (+5.9)   45.1 (-4.7)    4.9 (-1.2)</p>
<p> Insurance	     27.8 (+2.7)   62.7 (-0.9)    9.5 (-1.8)</p>
<p> Automotives	   82.0 (-2.1)   16.2 (+1.0)    1.8 (+1.1)</p>
<p> Chemicals	     79.3 (+6.4)   19.6 (-5.8)    1.1 (-0.6)</p>
